eigentliche Streit werde erst im Bundestag sichtbar","authoredText":"Der Minister erklärte, die Reform werde im nächsten Jahr umgesetzt. Die Opposition entgegnete, die geplanten Änderungen seien unzureichend durchdacht. Beobachter vermuten derweil, der eigentliche Streit werde erst im Bundestag sichtbar.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Zeitungsmeldung: Reform der Rentenversicherung angekündigt","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"c1-15-konjunktiv-i-und-indirekte-rede","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Timo, du hast die Konferenz ja verpasst — der Minister habe angeblich alle Vorwürfe zurückgewiesen.","speaker":"Grit","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_015_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-15-konjunktiv-i-und-indirekte-rede","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Und was sagt die andere Quelle dazu?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_015_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-15-konjunktiv-i-und-indirekte-rede","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Sie behauptet, er habe schon vorher davon gewusst, könne sich aber an nichts erinnern.","speaker":"Grit","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_015_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-15-konjunktiv-i-und-indirekte-rede","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Da widersprechen sich die Berichte ja deutlich — schwer zu sagen, wem man glauben soll.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_015_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-15-konjunktiv-i-und-indirekte-rede","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-15-konjunktiv-i-und-indirekte-rede","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Timo, du hast die Konferenz ja verpasst — der Minister habe angeblich alle Vorwürfe zurückgewiesen.","speaker":"Grit","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_015_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-15-konjunktiv-i-und-indirekte-rede","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Und was sagt die andere Quelle dazu?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_015_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-15-konjunktiv-i-und-indirekte-rede","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Sie behauptet, er habe schon vorher davon gewusst, könne sich aber an nichts erinnern.","speaker":"Grit","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_015_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-15-konjunktiv-i-und-indirekte-rede","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Da widersprechen sich die Berichte ja deutlich — schwer zu sagen, wem man glauben soll.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_015_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Der Minister habe alle Vorwürfe zurückgewiesen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c1-15-konjunktiv-i-und-indirekte-rede","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-15-konjunktiv-i-und-indirekte-rede","level":"C1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Timo hat die Konferenz verpasst. Berichte, was der Minister gesagt hat.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Sie behauptet, die Zahlen seien nie geprüft worden.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c1-15-konjunktiv-i-und-indirekte-rede","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-15-konjunktiv-i-und-indirekte-rede","level":"C1","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Timo fragt, was die andere Quelle dazu sagt.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"sp